# Server pull (locked — founder command)

Agent is command ke khilaf **nahi** jata. Add / hatao / restore mat rok.

```bash
cd /opt/anexomail-web \
&& git restore src/routeTree.gen.ts \
&& git pull --no-rebase origin main \
&& bun install \
&& bun run build:bun \
&& pm2 restart anexomail-web --update-env \
&& pm2 save \
&& curl -s -o /dev/null -w "web /health %{http_code}\n" --max-time 5 http://127.0.0.1:3000/health
```

Output padho: `web /health` **200** confirm. 200 nahi to code likho.
